  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2021, JakartaEM, Arus Pelangi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">this expenditure supports LGBTIQ+ persons and organisations in Indonesia, and provides management/organisational training for its members. The areas of LGBTIQ+ rights is a highly sensitive issue in Indonesia, where discrimination against, and criminalisation of, the LGBTIQ+ community is deeply entrenched. the funding will facilitate the enhancement of skills for members to organise, advocate and protect themselves. NGOs work in a very difficult environment and this project aims to support members and groups outside the Jakarta area, often in very conservative areas/regions.</narrative>
  </description>
